---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy — Incubate Labs"
  description="What this site does and doesn't do with data. Short, honest, no dark patterns."
>
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 pt-16 pb-12">
    <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-neutral-500 mb-4">Privacy</p>
    <h1 class="text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-6">Privacy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-neutral-500">Last updated: April 2026</p>
  </section>

  <hr class="max-w-page mx-auto" />

  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 text-neutral-800 leading-relaxed space-y-6">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">What this site does</h2>
    <p>
      <code>incubatelabs.ai</code> is a static site hosted on Cloudflare Pages. There is no login,
      no account, no first-party tracking cookie. The only first-party storage is whatever your
      browser caches in normal operation.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Sub-processors</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
      <li>
        <strong>Cloudflare</strong> hosts the site and provides the CDN. It logs request metadata
        (IP, user agent, timestamp) for fraud/abuse purposes per its standard policy.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Plausible Analytics</strong> (when enabled) aggregates page views without cookies,
        without persistent identifiers, and without sending anything to Google. Hosted in the EU.
        See <a href="https://plausible.io/data-policy" class="text-accent hover:underline">plausible.io/data-policy</a>.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Cal.com</strong> handles booking when you click through to schedule a call. Cal.com
        is the data controller for the booking record (your name, email, the time you picked).
        See <a href="https://cal.com/privacy" class="text-accent hover:underline">cal.com/privacy</a>.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Fonts</strong> (Inter, JetBrains Mono) are self-hosted via <code>@fontsource</code>.
        No requests to Google Fonts.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">If you email or book a call</h2>
    <p>
      I receive your email address, the time you picked, and whatever you wrote in the message.
      I use that to run the call and follow up afterwards. I don't add you to any mailing list and
      I don't sell or share contact details.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      Under UK GDPR you can ask what data I hold about you (likely just the booking record and
      any emails), ask me to delete it, or
      <a href="https://ico.org.uk/make-a-complaint/" class="text-accent hover:underline">complain to the ICO</a>.
      Email <a href="mailto:hello@incubatelabs.ai" class="text-accent hover:underline">hello@incubatelabs.ai</a>.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">No dark patterns</h2>
    <p>
      No pop-ups asking for cookies you don't need. No exit-intent modals. No newsletter
      subscription dressed up as a discount. If something annoys you about how this site works,
      tell me — I'll fix it.
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
